# Public demo additions, imported inside the Payverge site block by
# payverge.caddy (`import /etc/caddy/site.d/*.caddy`). Mounted only by
# demo/docker-compose.demo.yml; a normal install has no site.d.
#
# The site already carries payverge_security_headers (HSTS, nosniff,
# frame-deny, referrer and permissions policy). The demo adds:

# Never index the demo: its content is whatever visitors typed today.
header X-Robots-Tag "noindex, nofollow, noarchive"
